ESP32-S31-Zero board test commands␀  selftest | all              - automatic test; RGB keeps cycling red/green/blue␀␀␀␀  info                        - chip, reset, crystal, MAC, PSRAM␀␀␀␀  flash_info                  - JEDEC ID and detected physical capacity␀ERASE-TESTDATA␀␀  flash_rw %s   - destructive test of dedicated testdata sector only
␀␀␀  speed                       - read-only Flash and PSRAM throughput␀␀␀␀  gpio [out in cycles]        - digital loopback; default 8 9 100␀␀␀  irq [out in cycles]         - edge interrupt loopback; default 8 9 50␀  pwm <gpio hz duty seconds>  - timed LEDC output for oscilloscope␀␀  adc <gpio samples>          - raw ADC samples; valid ADC GPIO42-53,55-57␀␀  uart [tx rx]                - UART loopback; default 8 9; GPIO60 reserved for RGB␀  i2c                         - scan GPIO52 SDA / GPIO53 SCL␀␀␀␀  spi                         - 1 MHz SPI loopback on J2 GPIO20/23/24/25␀␀␀␀  usb                         - Type-C USB Serial/JTAG connection status␀␀␀␀  temp                        - on-die temperature (not board ambient)␀␀  wifi                        - active 2.4 GHz scan; J1 antenna required␀␀␀␀  stress <seconds>            - internal RAM/CPU stress, 1..3600 s␀␀  light_sleep <seconds>       - timer wake, 1..3600 s␀␀␀  deep_sleep <seconds>        - reset after timer wake, 1..3600 s␀␀␀  pins                        - print routed-pin safety notes␀␀␀  help
